messages.content:
For council verdicts, I recommend this structure:

```typescript
interface Verdict {
  id: string;
  timestamp: Date;
  taskId: string;
  judgeId: string;
  decision: 'approved' | 'rejected' | 'approved_with_conditions';
  confidence: number; // 0-1
  reasoning: string;
  evidence: Evidence[];
  ethicalAssessment: EthicalAssessment;
  interventionRequested: boolean;
  status: 'pending' | 'final' | 'under_review';
}
```

This captures all the essential information for the council oversight dashboard.
